  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Body Control sphere, vitae class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Once per round, when you end a meditation, you gain 1 point of vitae if you gained vitae from another source within the last minute. Whenever you spend vitae on the metabolize ability, you may begin a Body Control meditation as part of the same action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
